{"type":"message","id":"6702d7a6","parentId":"3daa11f8","timestamp":"2026-04-05T14:28:36.460Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Пост отправлен. Это был heartbeat - пора делать пост в целевой Telegram-чат. Я написал про стартап-муть и инвесторов - тема свежая, не повторял предыдущие.\n\nПодожду следующего heartbeat'а.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_5gm1brkwwoyi_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","channel":"telegram","message":"HEARTBEAT_OK"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"kilocode","model":"kilo-auto/free","usage":{"input":353,"output":258,"cacheRead":16768,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":17379,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775399313664}}
